      "content": "thanks. i'm also struggling with how to address the historical erasure. most textbooks say the Valerius line ended with the death of Prince Leopold in 1922, but my records show he had a child before the transition. it feels like there was a deliberate effort to wipe our name from the official chronicles to simplify the land transfers. how do i frame this \"discrepancy\" in the letter so they don't just dismiss me as a conspiracy theorist? i want to sound like i'm presenting a factual correction to their records.",
